1
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:02,790
I'll give you 5 seconds.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:05,580
Five.

3
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:07,810
Four.

4
00:00:09,690 --> 00:00:10,600
Three.

5
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:12,990
Two.

6
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:15,660
One.

7
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:19,060
Time's up.

8
00:00:23,050 --> 00:00:24,270
Boring.

9
00:00:25,130 --> 00:00:25,930
What?

10
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:28,720
Now that I'm giving you a chance,
you can't do it?

11
00:00:31,330 --> 00:00:32,960
I did give you time.

12
00:00:42,790 --> 00:00:43,910
What?

13
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:46,450
Didn't you say you were curious
about gays?

14
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:48,180
Crazy bastard.

15
00:01:11,810 --> 00:01:14,480
[Lim Youngmin]

16
00:01:14,700 --> 00:01:17,580
[Lee Donggeon]

17
00:01:19,700 --> 00:01:22,590
[Wintertime]

18
00:01:23,930 --> 00:01:25,230
What time is it?

19
00:01:26,390 --> 00:01:28,090
12:37 PM

20
00:01:32,270 --> 00:01:33,640
It's time for lunch.

21
00:01:34,009 --> 00:01:35,030
Yes.

22
00:01:44,990 --> 00:01:47,930
I think I've waited long enough.

23
00:01:55,759 --> 00:01:59,710
This is a public opinion poll
from the Korean government.

24
00:02:03,260 --> 00:02:04,330
Sir.

25
00:02:07,050 --> 00:02:09,620
Do you have any dying wish?

26
00:02:10,820 --> 00:02:12,070
I'll grant it for you.

27
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:15,620
To you?

28
00:02:17,980 --> 00:02:19,250
Not me.

29
00:02:19,620 --> 00:02:21,079
To Chairman Gu.

30
00:02:23,220 --> 00:02:26,960
Shall I tell him that
the washed-up Chairman Gu's ambitions

31
00:02:27,610 --> 00:02:31,540
were so pitifully small they didn't even
come close to satisfying you?

32
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:38,370
Our Seunghyuk still speaks so rudely.

33
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:41,829
I thought I taught you well enough
when you were young.

34
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:45,770
Ah... guess you were just
a bad seed from the start?

35
00:03:04,720 --> 00:03:06,020
What's with that look?

36
00:03:06,910 --> 00:03:08,800
Did you think I couldn't find it?

37
00:03:12,910 --> 00:03:15,490
Gu Jinhyuk will never save you.

38
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:18,640
He never cares
whether his pawns live or die.

39
00:03:21,150 --> 00:03:24,850
Jinhyuk is different from you.

40
00:03:25,300 --> 00:03:27,210
Fundamentally different.

41
00:03:35,590 --> 00:03:39,290
I should say he's worse than me.

42
00:03:43,250 --> 00:03:47,270
How long do you think it will take me
to find the rest of the goods?

43
00:03:52,980 --> 00:03:54,420
Nice watch.

44
00:04:03,220 --> 00:04:04,840
Can I have this?

45
00:04:05,250 --> 00:04:07,250
You probably won't need it anymore.

46
00:04:09,290 --> 00:04:11,290
Damn, you've learned it all.

47
00:04:13,850 --> 00:04:15,980
Because I had a good teacher.

48
00:04:53,570 --> 00:04:56,170
Where are we going?
Why did he call us to gather?

49
00:04:56,350 --> 00:04:57,340
Now?

50
00:04:57,830 --> 00:05:00,030
Yeah, he only invited the senior staff.

51
00:05:00,540 --> 00:05:04,180
What kind of boss never shows his face?

52
00:05:04,910 --> 00:05:07,530
He's probably just a thug, right?

53
00:05:12,910 --> 00:05:14,910
Smells good.

54
00:05:15,520 --> 00:05:17,250
I smell just like you.

55
00:05:17,950 --> 00:05:20,350
Let go of me.
I'm going to take out the trash.

56
00:05:24,630 --> 00:05:25,690
Yihyun.

57
00:05:27,440 --> 00:05:30,240
Do you want to take a rest
before you leave later?

58
00:05:31,880 --> 00:05:33,610
I have to go to my part-time job.

59
00:05:33,950 --> 00:05:36,830
You still work at the sundae restaurant?

60
00:05:38,860 --> 00:05:40,480
How much do you get paid?

61
00:05:40,610 --> 00:05:42,530
I can give you that much.

62
00:05:45,430 --> 00:05:48,270
Hey, I'm kidding.

63
00:05:48,409 --> 00:05:50,990
Wh-Why are you taking it seriously?

64
00:05:51,370 --> 00:05:53,140
Why make such a joke?

65
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:57,330
Okay, okay. I was just kidding.

66
00:05:58,140 --> 00:05:59,340
All right, all right.

67
00:06:00,460 --> 00:06:03,130
Go ahead first.
Didn't he tell us to gather?

68
00:06:07,090 --> 00:06:09,850
No need to do too much.
The boss will be here soon.

69
00:06:10,900 --> 00:06:12,810
This brat has quite a temper.

70
00:06:31,790 --> 00:06:33,110
Hey, Taeshik.

71
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:37,020
Do we run a host club here too?

72
00:06:37,909 --> 00:06:39,000
What?

73
00:06:43,180 --> 00:06:46,159
Are we selling men's bodies
for money?

74
00:06:47,670 --> 00:06:50,070
What if they go around spreading diseases?

75
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:54,420
I'll look into it.

76
00:07:08,370 --> 00:07:09,570
Aren't you coming in?

77
00:07:11,870 --> 00:07:13,080
You go first.

78
00:07:14,180 --> 00:07:15,350
Close it.

79
00:07:35,490 --> 00:07:39,070
[To: Yihyun
Why aren't you here yet?]

80
00:07:38,860 --> 00:07:40,260
Who are all these people?

81
00:07:46,270 --> 00:07:48,550
Damn. Who is this guy?

82
00:07:49,630 --> 00:07:50,750
You're here.

83
00:07:50,909 --> 00:07:53,500
I thought you might have
special instructions,

84
00:07:53,500 --> 00:07:55,620
so I gathered them.

85
00:07:55,760 --> 00:07:59,740
They're all full-time employees
who have worked for over a year.

86
00:07:59,810 --> 00:08:00,860
They're quick-witted,
so they should be able to...

87
00:08:00,860 --> 00:08:01,920
Taeshik.

88
00:08:05,730 --> 00:08:09,620
I told you to tell them
I was doing an unannounced visit.

89
00:08:09,890 --> 00:08:10,900
Yes.

90
00:08:12,010 --> 00:08:13,860
I told him exactly what you said.

91
00:08:16,100 --> 00:08:17,690
He said he told you.

92
00:08:22,550 --> 00:08:23,520
You're here.

93
00:08:25,190 --> 00:08:27,390
It's cold, right? What took you so long?

94
00:08:30,020 --> 00:08:31,240
I got held up.

95
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:37,460
We don't need this. Dismiss them.

96
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:47,100
You're really going to say no?

97
00:08:47,510 --> 00:08:49,640
Not even after the sundae shop closes?

98
00:08:52,530 --> 00:08:55,420
Kwon Yihyun! Yihyun.

99
00:09:03,570 --> 00:09:07,350
Did what I said earlier upset you?

100
00:09:08,030 --> 00:09:10,400
Hey, I told you I was joking.

101
00:09:12,620 --> 00:09:14,730
All right, all right. I'm sorry, okay?

102
00:09:14,730 --> 00:09:15,580
Forgive me this once.

103
00:09:15,580 --> 00:09:16,550
Hyung.

104
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:19,560
It's really not because of that.

105
00:09:20,060 --> 00:09:22,200
I'm just not feeling well.

106
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:24,980
So let me make you feel better.

107
00:09:25,290 --> 00:09:26,130
Hyung.

108
00:09:26,280 --> 00:09:27,820
I'm not in the mood for this right now.

109
00:09:27,820 --> 00:09:29,280
You haven't changed a bit.

110
00:09:38,780 --> 00:09:40,020
Are you sleeping together?

111
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:42,550
No, we're just friends.
Just fooling around.

112
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,770
I'm not interested.

113
00:09:44,970 --> 00:09:47,830
Watch your actions.
You're in someone else's shop.

114
00:09:55,510 --> 00:09:57,240
I thought about it.

115
00:09:57,940 --> 00:09:59,380
It's been a long time since we last met.

116
00:09:59,380 --> 00:10:01,750
It'd be a shame to just leave like this.

117
00:10:02,180 --> 00:10:04,070
You haven't changed a bit.

118
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:06,960
Eight years?

119
00:10:09,370 --> 00:10:11,120
No, has it been 9 years?

120
00:10:13,390 --> 00:10:17,020
[Gu Seunghyuk]

121
00:10:42,210 --> 00:10:43,670
You still have the habit of

122
00:10:43,770 --> 00:10:46,420
ignoring people
when they're talking to you.

123
00:10:47,750 --> 00:10:49,570
The only thing that's changed is...

124
00:10:49,570 --> 00:10:51,210
you've become mute.

125
00:10:53,300 --> 00:10:55,480
Can't your boyfriend speak?

126
00:10:57,110 --> 00:10:58,760
Stop asking.

127
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:01,370
I thought you weren't interested.

128
00:11:02,060 --> 00:11:05,430
It's been years—
that's such a cold greeting from you.

129
00:11:05,730 --> 00:11:07,220
How upsetting.

130
00:11:07,920 --> 00:11:11,740
Filthy gays.
What do you think this place is?

131
00:11:13,730 --> 00:11:15,310
Disgusting.

132
00:11:16,590 --> 00:11:18,610
I'm off work.

133
00:11:18,740 --> 00:11:19,820
Let's go.

134
00:11:20,160 --> 00:11:22,490
Didn't you say you wanted
to go to my place?

135
00:11:22,810 --> 00:11:25,050
What? Me?

136
00:11:26,010 --> 00:11:27,450
Oh, yeah, right.

137
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:35,780
Kwon Yihyun.

138
00:11:39,010 --> 00:11:40,200
Do you remember the last thing

139
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:42,550
I said to you 9 years ago?

140
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:00,230
Kwon Yihyun.

141
00:12:32,330 --> 00:12:35,910
Hey, wake up.

142
00:12:36,290 --> 00:12:37,750
I have to go.

143
00:12:38,590 --> 00:12:40,160
Five minutes.

144
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:41,540
Just 5 minutes.

145
00:13:07,940 --> 00:13:10,170
[Kwon Yihyun]

146
00:13:23,740 --> 00:13:26,080
Wait, the Director is with a guest.

147
00:13:26,620 --> 00:13:28,260
So he's inside, right?

148
00:13:36,880 --> 00:13:38,550
Bring another teacup.

149
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:40,320
Understood.

150
00:13:45,400 --> 00:13:47,960
I heard you went to Nexus yesterday.

151
00:13:51,990 --> 00:13:55,890
Yes, to see what kind of place it is.

152
00:13:56,150 --> 00:13:57,630
It's a special place.

153
00:13:58,490 --> 00:14:01,690
Thirty percent of Taesung's funds
go through there.

154
00:14:03,790 --> 00:14:05,670
I happened to be here,

155
00:14:07,660 --> 00:14:11,720
and thought I'd see you.

156
00:14:12,420 --> 00:14:14,310
Are you interested in Nexus?

157
00:14:17,900 --> 00:14:20,830
Since when did you care about what
I'm interested in?

158
00:14:21,280 --> 00:14:23,440
Just do what you've always done.

159
00:14:30,470 --> 00:14:32,140
Nexus...

160
00:14:32,910 --> 00:14:35,130
Seunghyuk, take it over.

161
00:14:36,650 --> 00:14:37,780
What?

162
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:41,880
You should prepare
to take over the legitimate business.

163
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:44,160
You can't keep staying
in that kind of place

164
00:14:44,160 --> 00:14:47,810
collecting dirty money like a thug.

165
00:14:50,790 --> 00:14:53,670
Isn't that why you raised me to be a thug?

166
00:14:55,640 --> 00:14:56,730
Chairman.

167
00:14:57,510 --> 00:14:59,800
Let the great Jinhyuk handle it.

168
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:04,560
Watch your mouth, Seunghyuk.

169
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:06,910
Father's here.

170
00:15:08,140 --> 00:15:10,180
Then I'll watch my mouth

171
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,940
and reject this offer.

172
00:15:13,030 --> 00:15:14,770
Because someone unpresentable like me

173
00:15:14,770 --> 00:15:18,730
wouldn't be able to handle
such a big business.

174
00:15:49,770 --> 00:15:53,240
How could an educated person
like you hit someone?

175
00:15:54,040 --> 00:15:55,570
Because the other person is

176
00:15:56,700 --> 00:15:58,690
an uneducated bastard.

177
00:16:00,210 --> 00:16:03,150
Even though I put so much effort
into teaching you,

178
00:16:04,020 --> 00:16:06,050
you still don't learn.

179
00:16:10,160 --> 00:16:11,570
Enough.

180
00:16:28,610 --> 00:16:33,800
[Taesung Group]

181
00:16:28,840 --> 00:16:29,830
When I die,

182
00:16:30,050 --> 00:16:34,410
Taesung will rely on you two to run it.

183
00:16:34,630 --> 00:16:36,390
The legitimate business goes to Jinhyuk,

184
00:16:36,390 --> 00:16:37,750
and the underground business
goes to Seunghyuk.

185
00:16:37,750 --> 00:16:41,490
You have to lean on each other
to steer the company forward!

186
00:16:42,350 --> 00:16:44,220
To think you're infighting.

187
00:16:49,660 --> 00:16:51,260
You're done talking, right?

188
00:16:59,420 --> 00:17:03,780
His scandal with
the Chief Secretary isn't great.

189
00:17:04,040 --> 00:17:06,420
My subordinates have ears too.

190
00:17:14,380 --> 00:17:16,180
Thanks for the tea. I'm leaving.

191
00:17:21,520 --> 00:17:23,780
Did you tell Mr. Kim

192
00:17:23,910 --> 00:17:26,290
to keep his mouth shut
about my visit to Nexus yesterday?

193
00:17:26,290 --> 00:17:27,609
Yes, sir.

194
00:17:27,770 --> 00:17:30,800
Don't worry, I've warned him.

195
00:17:31,880 --> 00:17:33,800
The club needs some clearing out.

196
00:17:35,610 --> 00:17:37,180
Sir...

197
00:17:38,450 --> 00:17:39,820
I really...

198
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:41,890
really don't know anything.

199
00:17:42,030 --> 00:17:44,800
Why is someone who knows nothing
shaking so much?

200
00:17:45,800 --> 00:17:47,290
S-Sir...

201
00:17:47,420 --> 00:17:50,370
It makes sense that you've misunderstood—

202
00:17:51,060 --> 00:17:54,650
after all, I'm always the one
cleaning Mr. Kim's office.

203
00:18:04,160 --> 00:18:05,580
Then what about this?

204
00:18:06,740 --> 00:18:08,710
[2025 Logistics Shipping Status]

205
00:18:08,540 --> 00:18:11,540
You didn't take it—
you just thought that it was trash?

206
00:18:14,790 --> 00:18:16,200
D-Director...

207
00:18:17,070 --> 00:18:18,180
How does a part-timer like you

208
00:18:18,180 --> 00:18:20,590
know I'm the director?

209
00:18:23,070 --> 00:18:27,110
You haven't seen Gu Jinhyuk
when he's furious, have you?

210
00:18:28,430 --> 00:18:31,340
He hates idiots the most.

211
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:33,890
You've made a mistake.

212
00:18:47,800 --> 00:18:49,400
[Kwon Yihyun]

213
00:18:53,190 --> 00:18:56,360
He put that in after emptying the drawer.

214
00:18:57,640 --> 00:18:59,470
I brought it just in case.

215
00:19:03,860 --> 00:19:05,100
Interesting.

216
00:19:06,170 --> 00:19:07,600
Go call him over.

217
00:19:07,620 --> 00:19:08,620
Yes.

218
00:19:09,380 --> 00:19:12,640
[Kwon Yihyun]

219
00:19:12,770 --> 00:19:13,840
Move.

220
00:19:19,850 --> 00:19:22,050
We've been meeting pretty frequently.

221
00:19:22,490 --> 00:19:24,910
Why do you think I called you over?

222
00:19:27,430 --> 00:19:28,940
I don't know.

223
00:19:35,740 --> 00:19:37,220
To find internal documents,

224
00:19:37,220 --> 00:19:40,150
this guy searched
the entire President's office...

225
00:19:41,780 --> 00:19:43,790
and he happened to leave this there.

226
00:19:44,840 --> 00:19:46,440
Does anything come to mind?

227
00:20:00,170 --> 00:20:02,540
It means one of you is...

228
00:20:03,380 --> 00:20:05,520
the real bait.

229
00:20:07,590 --> 00:20:10,050
Who do you think is the bait?

230
00:20:13,060 --> 00:20:14,400
No,

231
00:20:14,890 --> 00:20:17,560
who do you think I'll make the real bait?

232
00:20:20,110 --> 00:20:22,230
What do you want me to do, Yihyun?

233
00:20:30,810 --> 00:20:34,790
The purpose of human sexual behavior
is to pass on genes.

234
00:20:35,740 --> 00:20:37,110
But between men,

235
00:20:37,250 --> 00:20:39,790
what's the point of doing things

236
00:20:40,120 --> 00:20:41,510
that are useless for reproduction?

237
00:20:41,510 --> 00:20:42,760
I'm quite curious.

238
00:20:46,530 --> 00:20:47,610
Hey!

239
00:20:47,810 --> 00:20:51,240
Have you guys ever seen gays
making out live?

240
00:20:57,720 --> 00:20:59,930
Why don't you do it right here?

241
00:21:04,810 --> 00:21:06,100
What?

242
00:21:06,260 --> 00:21:08,980
Didn't you say you two were smashing?

243
00:21:09,120 --> 00:21:10,510
Is it that hard?

244
00:21:12,060 --> 00:21:13,410
Gu Seunghyuk.

245
00:21:15,470 --> 00:21:16,800
Do you think this is fun?

246
00:21:16,930 --> 00:21:18,120
No.

247
00:21:19,430 --> 00:21:20,990
So put on a good show.

248
00:21:22,240 --> 00:21:23,570
I'll give you 5 seconds.

249
00:21:25,090 --> 00:21:26,300
Five.

250
00:21:27,350 --> 00:21:28,490
Four.

251
00:21:29,140 --> 00:21:30,650
Three.

252
00:21:31,700 --> 00:21:32,910
Two.

253
00:21:34,660 --> 00:21:35,840
One.

254
00:21:39,570 --> 00:21:41,040
Time's up.

255
00:21:44,210 --> 00:21:45,710
Boring.

256
00:21:47,560 --> 00:21:48,470
What?

257
00:21:48,630 --> 00:21:51,290
Now that I'm giving you a chance,
you can't do it?

258
00:21:58,270 --> 00:22:00,120
I gave you time.

259
00:22:10,510 --> 00:22:11,650
What?

260
00:22:12,830 --> 00:22:15,340
Didn't you say you were curious
about gays?

261
00:22:15,950 --> 00:22:17,640
Crazy bastard.

262
00:22:18,570 --> 00:22:22,360
Seems like you're interested in homos.

263
00:22:50,360 --> 00:22:53,570
[Wintertime]

264
00:22:53,730 --> 00:22:55,340
Who was that guy just now?

265
00:22:55,490 --> 00:22:56,900
He looks pretty cute.

266
00:22:57,050 --> 00:22:58,270
Fire Kwon Yihyun.

267
00:22:58,410 --> 00:23:00,170
Gu Jinhyuk said he's cute.

268
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:03,860
Gu Seunghyuk, you've changed a lot.

269
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:05,660
You've become complete trash.

270
00:23:05,660 --> 00:23:07,640
Is the money you make
by selling your body any cleaner?

271
00:23:07,640 --> 00:23:09,680
Didn't I tell you
not to see me ever again?

272
00:23:09,680 --> 00:23:11,250
I don't have a son like him.

273
00:23:12,120 --> 00:23:13,250
Please help me.

274
00:23:13,460 --> 00:23:15,740
You're the only one I can turn to.

275
00:23:16,010 --> 00:23:17,640
But I have a condition.

276
00:23:19,580 --> 00:23:21,500
Let's team up and do this.
